OL,3,GNEWSA500 cannabis plants found after
OL,4,Afire above shop
OL,5,
OL,6,FAbout 500 suspected cannabis plants
OL,7,Fhave been discovered following a fire
OL,8,Fin Hull.
OL,10,FEmergency services were called to the
OL,11,Fblaze above a shop on Spring Bank at
OL,12,Fabout 08:00 GMT on Saturday.
OL,14,FHumberside Police said the plants were
OL,15,Ffound on two floors in the residential
OL,16,Farea of the building after the fire had
OL,17,Fbeen put out.
OL,19,FThe force said inquiries were
OL,20,Fcontinuing "to identify those
OL,21,Finvolved".
